Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4) Flat background and tensor representation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7613c985-3c5a-439c-9e97-355643ce5d22"],

Cell["\<\
Spacetime is the abstract d-dimensional background manifold. eta is a flat \
metric and CD its compatible derivative, so CD[eta] = 0. In Cartesian \
background coordinates CD equals the partial derivative used in the paper. \
xAct's PD is a separate derivative and is not automatically identified with \
CD. The determinant sign -1 in DefMetric assigns no explicit metric \
components. The following check verifies the metric, compatibility and \
vanishing curvature.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"05e00d66-90e3-4c76-a890-6108cef90686"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

