Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
11) Remark: explicit verification of equivalence between CLM and the Palatini \
action in terms of the complete Goldberg metric.\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001168387706788*^9, 4.001168388861569*^9}, {
  4.001168473814094*^9, 4.001168481004365*^9}, {4.001171453038168*^9, 
  4.0011715128330297`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cb10d896-215d-4c87-b7e7-\
2180e59800e8"],

Cell["\<\
As discussed in the paper, it is believed that the difference in surface term \
is due to an implicit integration by parts by CLM. This can be seen by \
comparing both actions written in terms of the complete Goldberg metric.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0011684900634823`*^9, 4.001168545866476*^9}, {
  4.0011685925333223`*^9, 4.0011686939155083`*^9}, {4.001168797776142*^9, 
  4.001168798287324*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f3c999d3-3d3b-47fb-b67e-\
d4dcd2426eb7"],

